---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Simon Plourde | IT Professional, Montréal" description="About Simon Plourde — Senior IT analyst based in Montréal with 10+ years in infrastructure, cybersecurity, and Microsoft cloud.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">{JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Simon Plourde",
    "url": "https://simonplourde.com",
    "jobTitle": "Senior Analyst, Infrastructure & Cybersecurity",
    "worksFor": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Groupe CH" },
    "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Montréal", "addressRegion": "QC", "addressCountry": "CA" },
    "knowsLanguage": ["en", "fr"],
    "sameAs": [
      "https://github.com/simon-plourde",
      "https://www.linkedin.com/in/simon-plourde-690987162/"
    ]
  })}</script>
  <div class="container">

    <section class="about-header">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p>I'm Simon, born and raised in Montreal. My relationship with tech started early — disassembling and rebuilding computers as a teenager, then gradually becoming the go-to tech person for friends and family. What started as a hobby turned into a career, and I've been down that rabbit hole ever since.</p>
      <p>Outside of IT, I'm a traveler. I spent a year in New Zealand on a working holiday visa, then another six months backpacking through East Asia — Thailand, Vietnam, and beyond. Experiencing different cultures and ways of life has a way of changing how you see things, and I wouldn't trade any of it.</p>
      <p>I'm also drawn to finance — the stock market, the whole ecosystem. There's something fascinating about trying to understand a system that affects everyone's life whether they're paying attention or not.</p>
      <p>Lately, AI has taken over a big part of my curiosity. I want to push myself to actually build with it — not just follow the hype, but use it the way I used computers when I was a kid: to make things, solve problems, and see what's possible. This website is part of that.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Experience</p>

      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">Senior Analyst, Infrastructure & Cybersecurity</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">July 2025 – Present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Groupe CH — Montréal, QC</div>
        <div class="resume-entry-desc">Leads infrastructure and cybersecurity across 10+ physical sites as Global Microsoft 365 & Azure administrator. Owns the full stack — network (firewall, switching, Wi-Fi), server infrastructure (ESX, VMs, SAN storage), and cloud — for Centre Bell, the largest venue in Montreal, Place Bell, and major festivals including Jazz de Montréal, Osheaga, IleSoniq, and other Evenko and Équipe Spectra productions.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">Network & Systems Administrator</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">July 2020 – July 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Groupe CH — Montréal, QC</div>
        <div class="resume-entry-desc">Grew into owning the network and systems infrastructure across the organization. Managed AD, Azure, and on-site network deployments for major venues and festivals — Centre Bell, Place Bell, Jazz de Montréal, Osheaga, IleSoniq, and other Evenko and Équipe Spectra productions.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">IT Technician</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">January 2017 – July 2020</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Groupe CH — Montréal, QC</div>
        <div class="resume-entry-desc">Started in hands-on IT support across multiple sites, handling tier 1 to 3. Over time took on bigger projects: a full Windows 7→10 fleet migration, cloud migration for files and email, remote work infrastructure rollout, and a complete office and server room relocation.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Education</p>
      <div class="resume-entry">
        <div class="resume-entry-header">
          <span class="resume-entry-title">DEC, Network Management</span>
          <span class="resume-entry-date">2012 – 2014</span>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-entry-org">Collège LaSalle — Montréal, QC</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <p class="resume-label">Skills</p>
      <div class="skills-wrap">
        <span class="skill">Active Directory</span>
        <span class="skill">Azure / Entra</span>
        <span class="skill">Microsoft 365</span>
        <span class="skill">Exchange</span>
        <span class="skill">SharePoint</span>
        <span class="skill">PowerShell</span>
        <span class="skill">Palo Alto</span>
        <span class="skill">Cisco / Meraki</span>
        <span class="skill">Arista</span>
        <span class="skill">Ubiquiti</span>
        <span class="skill">Networking</span>
        <span class="skill">Cybersecurity</span>
        <span class="skill">LibreNMS</span>
        <span class="skill">Virtualization</span>
        <span class="skill">AI</span>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
